---
/**
 * Loads the Elfsight platform once, sitewide.
 *
 * It used to live inside Reviews.astro, which was right when reviews appeared
 * on two pages. The floating badge is sitewide, so the loader has to be too —
 * and it must not be emitted twice on the pages that carry both.
 *
 * `async` so it never blocks first paint; each widget also carries
 * `data-elfsight-app-lazy` so it only initializes near the viewport.
 */
---

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://elfsightcdn.com" crossorigin />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://core.service.elfsight.com" crossorigin />
<script src="https://elfsightcdn.com/platform.js" async is:inline></script>
